  "findings": [
    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "In `checkIfIsAvailable`, the new override logic compares `dayjs(date.start).add(utcOffset, \"minutes\")` to `slotStartTime`, but `utcOffset` is derived from `dayjs.tz(date.start, organizerTimeZone)` and then negated. This mixes organizer/invitee offsets and can shift the override date into the wrong calendar day, causing slots to be rejected or accepted outside the intended override window when event and attendee time zones differ.",
